  #sol-item(1, "B", dense: true, pad: 0.0pt)[
    Form carrying meaning is the definition; importance, performance and celebrity belong to other kinds of writing.
  ]
  ]

  #sol-item(2, "A", dense: true, pad: 0.0pt)[
    A syllabus is a decision about teaching, not a property of the text; the other three are the three tests.
  ]

  #sol-item(3, "C", dense: true, pad: 0.0pt)[
    Drama, prose and poetry are the genres; the other lists are divisions within one of them.
  ]

  #sol-item(4, "D", dense: true, pad: 0.0pt)[
    Action, narration or compression: the mode of arrival is the defining mark.
  ]

  #sol-item(5, "C", dense: true, pad: 0.0pt)[
    A theme is a claim and therefore needs a verb; the subject is the topic it is a claim about.
  ]

  #sol-item(6, "C", dense: true, pad: 0.0pt)[
